      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Shows:** Core's own counters: events written, queries served, stored bytes and HTTP traffic by endpoint. Core has no tenant label; per-tenant usage is in section 2. **Act when:** queries climb while events written stay flat. That is polling, and section 3 says which shape."
